{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type InferCollectionType<T> = T extends CollectionImpl<infer TOutput, infer TKey, any, any, any> ? WithVirtualProps<TOutput, TKey> : T extends CollectionOptionsIdentity<infer TOutput, infer TKey, any, any, any> ? WithVirtualProps<TOutput, TKey> : never;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L108","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:108"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"InferCollectionType - Extracts the TypeScript type from a CollectionImpl"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This helper ensures we get the same type that was used when creating the collection itself.\nThis can be an explicit type passed by the user or the schema output type."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype InferCollectionType<T> = T extends CollectionImpl<infer TOutput, infer TKey, any, any, any> ? WithVirtualProps<TOutput, TKey> : T extends CollectionOptionsIdentity<infer TOutput, infer TKey, any, any, any> ? WithVirtualProps<TOutput, TKey> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:108](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L108)\n\nInferCollectionType - Extracts the TypeScript type from a CollectionImpl\n\nThis helper ensures we get the same type that was used when creating the collection itself.\nThis can be an explicit type passed by the user or the schema output type.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: InferCollectionType\ntitle: InferCollectionType\n---\n\n```ts\ntype InferCollectionType<T> = T extends CollectionImpl<infer TOutput, infer TKey, any, any, any> ? WithVirtualProps<TOutput, TKey> : T extends CollectionOptionsIdentity<infer TOutput, infer TKey, any, any, any> ? WithVirtualProps<TOutput, TKey> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:108](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L108)\n\nInferCollectionType - Extracts the TypeScript type from a CollectionImpl\n\nThis helper ensures we get the same type that was used when creating the collection itself.\nThis can be an explicit type passed by the user or the schema output type.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n"}
